# GitHub Repos (Collections) API - Apideck
created: 2019-01-01, last updated: 2026-02-03, [Read more](https://www.apideck.com/integrations/github/repos)

In Apideck, this resource is called Collections (API:
...
import { Apideck } from '@apideck/unify'
const apideck = new Apideck({
apiKey: process.env.APIDECK_API_KEY,
appId: 'YOUR_APP_ID',
consumerId: 'YOUR_CONSUMER_ID'
})
// List repos from GitHub
const result = await apideck.issue-tracking.collections.list({
serviceId: 'github'
})
